Zayn's MiniMind

This project includes code and tokenizer assets adapted from MiniMind:
https://github.com/jingyaogong/minimind
Source snapshot: f659b55761b754d306bd140573493a6543cafd7f
Upstream author: Jingyao Gong and MiniMind contributors
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE)

Derived components: model/model_minimind.py, model/model_lora.py,
model/tokenizer.json, and model/tokenizer_config.json.

Modifications include English source comments, descriptive attention variables,
configuration validation, explicit causal/padding masks with cached decoding,
embedding-input support, and adapter validation/dtype handling. Parameter keys
and tokenizer vocabulary IDs are retained for checkpoint compatibility.

The project training pipeline, configurations, generated fixtures, tests, and
CI are maintained separately from the upstream trainers. Upstream documentation,
demos, images, and duplicate training entry points are omitted.
